    narr:generatedFrom "d60479f4df57bd74c60ef357e16a3ce7cbb09a43" ;
    narr:narration """Xavier's voice here runs on [metaphor and analogy](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_105) — [the telephone company always wins](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_105), [Emery Park as the howitzer](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_185) — layered over [stock phrases](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_35) and [antithesis framing](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_199). The what: a portfolio narration running from [a messy ERP consulting gig](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_37) through [crane-mat project prospecting](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_39), [predicting which quotes lose margin](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_47), [a personal-graph tool mined from email](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_55), [an edge-AI Slack alternative](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_77), to [a sovereign-AI pilot abroad](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_59). Two theses anchor the work: [the sit-in-between moat](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_109) and [micro SaaS for companies too small for the big consultancies](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_133), priced at [a monthly retainer figure](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_135). He coaches his interlocutor toward [applying to a famous accelerator](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_143) and [running a time-bound raise process](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_199).""" ;
